### Remove a service area from a vehicle
### Areas are not edited in place: remove the old one and add a new one. Use an id from list-service-areas.http.
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/travel-partners/4aa12692-6972-4772-8c54-19d5933f76bc/vehicles/d403ccd6-4cc9-4cd8-8ca2-170e37c4632a/service-areas/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv YOCABS_TOKEN}}
